The inequality specifies every number $12x - 5$ whose distance from zero is greater than or equal to $7$. This corresponds to the following compound inequality:

$$
12x - 5\begin{vmatrix}\le - 7 & or & 12x - 5\end{vmatrix}\ge 7
$$

Now, we can solve each inequality using the usual methods.

$$
\begin{bmatrix}12x - 5 & \le - 7 & 12x - 5 & \ge 7 \\ 12x & \le - 2 & 12x & \ge 12 \\ x & \le - \frac{2}{12} & x & \ge \frac{12}{12} \\ x & \le - \frac{1}{6} & x & \ge 1\end{bmatrix}
$$

Therefore, the final solution is

$$
x\begin{vmatrix}\le - \frac{1}{6} & or & x\end{vmatrix}\ge 1
$$"} {:db/id 17592186050680} {:db/id 17592186069134 :question/id #uuid "8c8b34f1-21c9-5aa7-bcbf-14f8fe678f92" :question/math-academy-id "q-215496"} {:db/id 17592186069135 :question/id #uuid "a92a4124-bc7c-5436-968f-ce759fb4d648" :question/math-academy-id "q-215707" :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186068719 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "c4f7e042-a8fa-50c8-a502-1397138dc380" :knowledge-point/title "Absolute Value Inequalities Containing a Greater Than (or Equal To) Symbol"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/id #uuid "bcca67ee-d00b-5ed9-a1a5-a17cc2e60ae9" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id 17592186066149} {:answer-field/id #uuid "33b677ae-2eee-5574-a670-188edbba3875" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id 17592186066150} {:answer-field/id #uuid "503e8508-9d51-5534-9ba4-e03eddaf3997" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id 17592186066151}] :question/problem "Solve the absolute value inequality $\mid \frac{5 - 9a}{2} \mid \ge 7$.$a$
