t
${f}^{′}(x,y)=\begin{bmatrix}-4y+1 & 3{y}^{2}-4x-1\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f:{R}^{n}\to R,$ given by

$$
f:{{\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\ {x}_{2} \\ ⋮ \\ {x}_{n}\end{bmatrix}}_{⏟}}_{x}⟶f({x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}),
$$

the second derivative of $f$ is given by the $n\times n$ matrix

$$
{f}^{″}(x)=\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}.
$$

In our case, we have

$$
{f}^{″}(x,y)=\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}.
$$

First, notice that since ${f}^{′}(x,y)=\begin{bmatrix}-4y+1 & 3{y}^{2}-4x-1\end{bmatrix},$ we must have

$$
\frac{∂f}{∂x}=-4y+1,\,\frac{∂f}{∂y}=3{y}^{2}-4x-1.
$$

Now, we compute the second partial derivatives:

$$
\begin{aligned}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\frac{∂}{∂x}(-4y+1)=0\, & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\frac{∂}{∂x}(3{y}^{2}-4x-1)=-4 \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\frac{∂}{∂y}(-4y+1)=-4\, & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\frac{∂}{∂y}(3{y}^{2}-4x-1)=6y\end{aligned}
$$

So, the second derivative is

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\ -4 & 6y\end{bmatrix}.\end{aligned}
$$"} {:db/id 17592186430444 :question/id #uuid "89d73552-bd61-5afc-9133-1cbf2f95b120" :question/math-academy-id "q-81008"} {:db/id 17592186430447 :question/id #uuid "ed948579-cdd5-5155-941d-e802c724684f" :question/math-academy-id "q-163633"} {:db/id 17592186435393 :question/id #uuid "a68b0724-2e6f-5527-bb88-98de4c797f20" :question/math-academy-id "q-81010"} {:db/id 17592186435394 :question/id #uuid "d48bb18b-a23a-5640-ba69-c0db05f527bc" :question/math-academy-id "q-102452" :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186157423 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "74c4234a-3aa1-5b6b-b68b-48e6aa2b0dfb" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Second Derivative of a Function Given Its First Derivative"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3f5dbce3-5eeb-5299-a81b-71b95b40a702" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -2 \\ -2 & 2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186435379} {:answer/id #uuid "533319f1-cf66-5e55-a50b-27c89a39ea11" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\ -2 & 2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186435382} {:answer/id #uuid "afde4582-cdac-5bc3-b210-1397789ef534" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -4 \\ -4 & 2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186435386} {:answer/id #uuid "ef6b5589-dee3-5358-89b2-bb7e5109233c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 \\ -2 & 2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186435388} {:answer/id #uuid "f224da51-5558-5714-9c8e-ab71238f6195" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\ 4 & 2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186435389}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "afde4582-cdac-5bc3-b210-1397789ef534" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -4 \\ -4 & 2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 1759218643538