{f}^{″}(x,y)=\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}.
$$

First, we compute the first derivative of $f(x,y),$ as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x,y) & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂f}{∂x} & \frac{∂f}{∂y}\end{bmatrix} \\  & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂}{∂x}(y\operatorname{ln}⁡x-{y}^{2}) & \frac{∂}{∂y}(y\operatorname{ln}⁡x-{y}^{2})\end{bmatrix} \\  & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{y}{x} & \operatorname{ln}⁡x-2y\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Now, we compute the second partial derivatives:

$$
\begin{aligned}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\frac{∂}{∂x}(\frac{y}{x})=-\frac{y}{{x}^{2}}\, & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\frac{∂}{∂x}(\operatorname{ln}⁡x-2y)=\frac{1}{x} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\frac{∂}{∂y}(\frac{y}{x})=\frac{1}{x}\, & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\frac{∂}{∂y}(\operatorname{ln}⁡x-2y)=-2\end{aligned}
$$

So, the second derivative is

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =\begin{bmatrix}-\frac{y}{{x}^{2}} & \frac{1}{x} \\ \frac{1}{x} & -2\end{bmatrix}.\end{aligned}
$$

Finally, we evaluate this matrix at $(1,2).$ This gives

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(1,2)=\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\ 1 & -2\end{bmatrix}.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "63ea7e02-9f7a-5a09-b718-d06795e4cb97" :step/next {:db/id 17592186481442}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "93574e00-8aff-52c2-8fef-8d24d76bb02a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481016} {:answer/id #uuid "aee9d420-4960-50a5-922a-c43137c76d7d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1 \\ 1 & -2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481067} {:answer/id #uuid "bc4a4294-c877-56f6-bfd0-3109ee79c13c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\ 1 & -4\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481097} {:answer/id #uuid "c00142a0-9805-5734-8860-3bf5256f853f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -1 \\ -1 & -2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481104} {:answer/id #uuid "e631a5f0-8bc9-5fbb-b72c-fddfe67625ed" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\ 1 & -2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481177}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186481177} :answer-field/id #uuid "3cad98c5-f0af-530e-9545-f63d666cd3ea" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186481264} {:answer/id #uuid "93574e00-8aff-52c2-8fef-8d24d76bb02a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481016} {:answer/id #uuid "aee9d420-4960-50a5-922a-c43137c76d7d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1 \\ 1 & -2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481067} {:answer/id #uuid "bc4a4294-c877-56f6-bfd0-3109ee79c13c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\ 1 & -4\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481097} {:answer/id #uuid "c00142a0-9805-5734-8860-3bf5256f853f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -1 \\ -1 & -2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481104} {:answer/id #uuid "e631a5f0-8bc9-5fbb-b72c-fddfe67625ed" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\ 1 & -2\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481177} {:db/id 17592186481455 :step/content {:db/id 17592186157541 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2fca28ad-f59e-5a0a-bb4c-0662386d1e94" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\ -1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186480829} {:answer/id #uuid "3075a971-db98-5b66-a3d1-9af12fdf7be7" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\ -1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186480831} {:answer/id #uuid "8cb3995c-cc62-5136-82b2-472b0cb824be" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481006} {:answer/id #uuid "d0ef3863-4e52-56dd-9984-66598e15e8ff" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\ 1 & 1\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481130} {:answer/id #uuid "dc10b03f-56c5-527c-94f1-47709864755a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481155}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186481006} :answer-field/id #uuid "28c26c69-61cb-5d08-9210-43f100a3d7fe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186153490}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "cd7463fc-6818-5da6-ab8a-b593c73ec670" :question/math-academy-id "q-102699" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{″}(1,0)$ for the function $f(x,y)=xy-{x}^{2}{y}^{3}.$" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f:{R}^{n}\to R,$ given by

$$
f:{{\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\ {x}_{2} \\ ⋮ \\ {x}_{n}\end{bmatrix}}_{⏟}}_{x}⟶f({x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}),
$$

the second derivative of $f$ is given by the $n\times n$ matrix

$$
{f}^{″}(x)=\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}.
$$

In our case, we have

$$
{f}^{″}(x,y)=\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}.
$$

First, we compute the first derivative of $f(x,y),$ as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x,y) & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂f}{∂x} & \frac{∂f}{∂y}\end{bmatrix} \\  & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂}{∂x}(xy-{x}^{2}{y}^{3}) & \frac{∂}{∂y}(xy-{x}^{2}{y}^{3})\end{bmatrix} \\  & =\begin{bmatrix}y-2x{y}^{3} & x-3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Now, we compute the second partial derivatives:

$$
\begin{aligned}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\frac{∂}{∂x}(y-2x{y}^{3})=-2{y}^{3}\, & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\frac{∂}{∂x}(x-3{x}^{2}{y}^{2})=1-6x{y}^{2} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\frac{∂}{∂y}(y-2x{y}^{3})=1-6x{y}^{2}\, & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\frac{∂}{∂y}(x-3{x}^{2}{y}^{2})=-6{x}^{2}y\end{aligned}
$$

So, the second derivative is

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =\begin{bmatrix}-2{y}^{3} & 1-6x{y}^{2} \\ 1-6x{y}^{2} & -6{x}^{2}y\end{bmatrix}.\end{aligned}
$$

Finally, we evaluate this matrix at $(1,0).$ This gives

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(1,0)=\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "66302a80-8659-5359-be45-331fa2372867"} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2fca28ad-f59e-5a0a-bb4c-0662386d1e94" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\ -1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186480829} {:answer/id #uuid "3075a971-db98-5b66-a3d1-9af12fdf7be7" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\ -1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186480831} {:answer/id #uuid "8cb3995c-cc62-5136-82b2-472b0cb824be" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481006} {:answer/id #uuid "d0ef3863-4e52-56dd-9984-66598e15e8ff" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\ 1 & 1\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481130} {:answer/id #uuid "dc10b03f-56c5-527c-94f1-47709864755a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481155}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186481006} :answer-field/id #uuid "28c26c69-61cb-5d08-9210-43f100a3d7fe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186153490} {:answer/id #uuid "2fca28ad-f59e-5a0a-bb4c-0662386d1e94" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\ -1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186480829} {:answer/id #uuid "3075a971-db98-5b66-a3d1-9af12fdf7be7" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\ -1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186480831} {:answer/id #uuid "8cb3995c-cc62-5136-82b2-472b0cb824be" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\ 1 & 0\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481006} {:answer/id #uuid "d0ef3863-4e52-56dd-9984-66598e15e8ff" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\ 1 & 1\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186481130} {:answer/id #uuid "dc10b03f-56c5-527c-94f1-47709864755a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\begi