"13eba5b3-5ee1-54a2-a165-599feede7427" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\frac{3}{5}" :db/id 17592186244494} {:answer/id #uuid "1e2f0aad-80c7-52df-b8b1-92ab89cc1a7a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{1}{5}" :db/id 17592186244578} {:answer/id #uuid "74346772-ee82-5598-92fc-961da1e54b1f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{2}{5}" :db/id 17592186245348} {:answer/id #uuid "933b4cc2-b259-5d0b-aed0-2acad610e648" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2" :db/id 17592186245597}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186244578} :answer-field/id #uuid "35c107e1-441a-5e9e-a64c-c9d6f455a387" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186246638}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "34f629c1-9fcd-59d6-b73f-996bb1a66a78" :question/math-academy-id "q-110347" :question/problem "Consider the function $f(x)=-3+5{e}^{x+1}.$ Given that $y=f(x)$ is invertible throughout its domain, determine $({f}^{-1})^{′}(2).$" :question/worked-solution "To determine $({f}^{-1})^{′}(2),$ we use the following formula:

$$
{({f}^{-1})}^{′}(2)=\frac{1}{{f}^{′}({f}^{-1}(2))}
$$

First, we calculate the value of ${f}^{-1}(2).$ To do this, we solve the equation ${f}^{-1}(2)=x.$ This gives

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{-1}(2) & =x \\ f(x) & =2 \\ -3+5{e}^{x+1} & =2 \\ 5{e}^{x+1} & =5 \\ {e}^{x+1} & =1 \\ x+1 & =0 \\ x & =-1.\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, ${f}^{-1}(2)=-1.$

Now, we calculate ${f}^{′}(-1),$ as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}f(x) & =-3+5{e}^{x+1} \\ {f}^{′}(x) & =5{e}^{x+1} \\ {f}^{′}(-1) & =5{e}^{0} \\ {f}^{′}(-1) & =5\end{aligned}
$$

Finally, we get

$$
\begin{aligned}{({f}^{-1})}^{′}(2) & =\frac{1}{{f}^{′}({f}^{-1}(2))} \\  & =\frac{1}{{f}^{′}(-1)} \\  & =\frac{1}{5}.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "a496245c-b30d-521d-bb6c-1805665cc858"} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01506915-9279-5845-be61-c4c35f7caa00" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id 17592186244319} {:answer/id #uuid "13eba5b3-5ee1-54a2-a165-599feede7427" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\frac{3}{5}" :db/id 17592186244494} {:answer/id #uuid "1e2f0aad-80c7-52df-b8b1-92ab89cc1a7a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{1}{5}" :db/id 17592186244578} {:answer/id #uuid "74346772-ee82-5598-92fc-961da1e54b1f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{2}{5}" :db/id 17592186245348} {:answer/id #uuid "933b4cc2-b259-5d0b-aed0-2acad610e648" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2" :db/id 17592186245597}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186244578} :answer-field/id #uuid "35c107e1-441a-5e9e-a64c-c9d6f455a387" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186246638} {:answer/id #uuid "01506915-9279-5845-be61-c4c35f7caa00" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id 17592186244319} {:answer/id #uuid "13eba5b3-5ee1-54a2-a165-599feede7427" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\frac{3}{5}" :db/id 17592186244494} {:answer/id #uuid "1e2f0aad-80c7-52df-b8b1-92ab89cc1a7a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{1}{5}" :db/id 17592186244578} {:answer/id #uuid "74346772-ee82-5598-92fc-961da1e54b1f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{2}{5}" :db/id 17592186245348} {:answer/id #uuid "933b4cc2-b259-5d0b-aed0-2acad610e648" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2" :db/id 17592186245597} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ecb3b6c-5f9d-519e-ac19-a3e22b342ea6" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\frac{1}{6}" :db/id 17592186409823} {:answer/id #uuid "614852f7-d26e-56cc-93b6-f07f9c417f8d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{1}{3}" :db/i