e {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{7}{10}" :db/id 17592186153882} {:answer/id #uuid "eb402453-8e9e-5d3c-a06e-96fbfc84d9da" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{9}{5}" :db/id 17592186153883} {:answer/id #uuid "f418ec1e-ed9d-5bce-a47f-762f1c808098" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{19}{10}" :db/id 17592186153884} {:answer/id #uuid "63a0df93-12b0-5a94-8153-cab57c777d0a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{17}{10}" :db/id 17592186153885}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186153883} :answer-field/id #uuid "07e9af8f-c53a-563f-b1d5-c1fb676708fa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186153880}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "d40b16f4-c022-5679-aaee-aa1be46926d5" :question/math-academy-id "q-149708" :question/problem "The continuous random variable $X$ has the following probability density function:

$$
f(x)=\frac{3{x}^{2}+4}{5},\,0<x<1
$$

Given that $\text{E}[X]=\frac{11}{20},$ compute $\text{E}[2X-{X}^{3}+1].$

*Hint: You may assume that $\text{E}[aX+bY]=a\text{E}[X]+b\text{E}[Y]$ for any random variables $X$ and $Y$ and constants $a$ and $b.$*" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify using the hint and the properties of expected value:

$$
\begin{aligned}\text{E}[2X-{X}^{3}+1] & =2\text{E}[X]-\text{E}[{X}^{3}]+\text{E}[1] \\  & =2\text{E}[X]-\text{E}[{X}^{3}]+1\end{aligned}
$$

For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the $n$th raw moment of $X$ is given by

$$
\text{E}[{X}^{n}]={\int }_{S}{x}^{n}\cdot f(x)\,\text{d}x.
$$

We already know $\text{E}[X].$ So, we compute the third raw moment of $X$ as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}\text{E}[{X}^{3}] & ={\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{3}\cdot (\frac{3{x}^{2}+4}{5})\text{d}x \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{1}(\frac{3}{5}{x}^{5}+\frac{4}{5}{x}^{3})\text{d}x \\  & ={(\frac{1}{10}{x}^{6}+\frac{1}{5}{x}^{4})|}_{0}^{1} \\  & =\frac{1}{10}+\frac{1}{5} \\  & =\frac{3}{10}\end{aligned}
$$

Substituting $\text{E}[X]=\frac{11}{20}$ and $\text{E}[{X}^{3}]=\frac{3}{10}$ into the simplified expression, we conclude that

$$
\begin{aligned}\text{E}[2X-{X}^{3}+1] & =2\text{E}[X]-\text{E}[{X}^{3}]+1 \\  & =2\cdot \frac{11}{20}-\frac{3}{10}+1 \\  & =\frac{11}{10}-\frac{3}{10}+1 \\  & =\frac{9}{5}.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "473a0974-6e51-5843-94d7-0cf17d7cd776" :step/next {:db/id 17592186479149}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a69b927d-fd51-516f-aae0-cf0da09a7720" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{4}{5}" :db/id 17592186153881} {:answer/id #uuid "e3ba8dfc-c937-598b-a9a5-dc59f7c01e72" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{7}{10}" :db/id 17592186153882} {:answer/id #uuid "eb402453-8e9e-5d3c-a06e-96fbfc84d9da" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{9}{5}" :db/id 17592186153883} {:answer/id #uuid "f418ec1e-ed9d-5bce-a47f-762f1c808098" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{19}{10}" :db/id 17592186153884} {:answer/id #uuid "63a0df93-12b0-5a94-8153-cab57c777d0a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{17}{10}" :db/id 17592186153885}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186153883} :answer-field/id #uuid "07e9af8f-c53a-563f-b1d5-c1fb676708fa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186153880} {:answer/id #uuid "a69b927d-fd51-516f-aae0-cf0da09a7720" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{4}{5}" :db/id 17592186153881} {:answer/id #uuid "e3ba8dfc-c937-598b-a9a5-dc59f7c01e72" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{7}{10}" :db/id 17592186153882} {:answer/id #uuid "eb402453-8e9e-5d3c-a06e-96fbfc84d9da" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{9}{5}" :db/id 17592186153883} {:answer/id #uuid "f418ec1e-ed9d-5bce-a47f-762f1c808098" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{19}{10}" :db/id 17592186153884} {:answer/id #uuid "63a0df93-12b0-5a94-8153-cab57c777d0a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{17}{10}" :db/id 17592186153885} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1370ffbd-2eab-5260-a0b4-0bf5d3cdb6db" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{9}{5}" :db/id 17592186478582} {:answer/id #uuid "7f3f6cb5-53fa-5af5-81d3-8308