| $\textrm F$ | $\textrm F$ | $\textrm F$ | $\color{blue} \textrm F$ | $\color{blue} \textrm F$ |

- The following truth table shows that $A \lor (B \land C)  \equiv (A \lor B) \land (A \lor C){:}$

| $\,A\,$ | $\,B\,$ | $\,C\,$ | $\, A \lor (B \land C) \,$ | $\, (A \lor B) \land (A \lor C) \,$ |
