Hence, the required probability is $F(5)=1-\frac{1}{5}=\frac{4}{5}.$"} :step/id #uuid "b81f8974-1a7b-53cb-bb5f-1b47021e293e" :step/next {:db/id 17592186424889}} {:db/id 17592186424889 :step/content {:db/id 17592186424886 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "492f777b-8264-55ab-9be1-d1359bd9513d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}" :db/id 17592186424871} {:answer/id #uuid "4a7a5540-6762-5260-9b7f-2a98061bf95e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "1-\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{4}" :db/id 17592186424872} {:answer/id #uuid "50e4b7f0-64ef-587b-bfde-a4520b836560" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "1+\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}" :db/id 17592186424873} {:answer/id #uuid "d60102cb-368c-5209-b3c3-06d9c44b89a2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{1}{2}-\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}" :db/id 17592186424880} {:answer/id #uuid "ef55c585-a616-50c9-9382-ffb7b5a8ceda" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "1-\frac{{e}^{-x/3}}{2}" :db/id 17592186424881}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186424881} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce55fccd-c2b9-544b-881d-b59a7e7c0f42" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186424884}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "2b70eaac-0c45-5da5-8a2f-2002d9071035" :question/math-academy-id "q-89727" :question/problem "Given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function

