5" :question/math-academy-id "q-140483"} {:db/id 17592186272107 :question/id #uuid "762f53a4-6eba-533a-aefb-847dcb22ecb6" :question/math-academy-id "q-140484"} {:db/id 17592186351223 :question/id #uuid "25a9c5a2-c2b4-580a-a454-817fa98a8c5d" :question/math-academy-id "q-81109"} {:db/id 17592186351423 :question/id #uuid "2c1e164f-769d-52d4-a09c-f8474e7b2368" :question/math-academy-id "q-82401"} {:db/id 17592186351542 :question/id #uuid "757ea74d-034b-5cf5-b116-1f66ebbe72c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-83745"} {:db/id 17592186371133 :question/id #uuid "d2ecf41d-bb8c-5910-8164-c718a9bc187a" :question/math-academy-id "q-82400"} {:db/id 17592186371167 :question/id #uuid "5d55bdef-1f91-5e0a-9c79-2e4df04e0183" :question/math-academy-id "q-83739"} {:db/id 17592186433153 :question/id #uuid "bccef2e2-efdc-5751-b184-d287795e3e5f" :question/math-academy-id "q-82399"}] :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Sets are Orthonormal"} {:db/id 17592186133590 :question/id #uuid "4b092f86-cf53-51b4-9f79-b43d58c8b2e5" :question/math-academy-id "e-5563"} {:db/id 17592186134215 :question/id #uuid "89970297-1b2c-5ba8-b18f-ccd95df5c317" :question/math-academy-id "q-39398"} {:db/id 17592186134283 :question/id #uuid "8a16aa05-69e5-512f-a13b-bab98b847583" :question/math-academy-id "q-40365" :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186133781 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ed5c8af7-e617-5e8c-be01-45a26eb17d4d" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Sets are Orthonormal"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "010d84a7-1ce6-5b20-8fb6-ef470203e66a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$U$ and $W$ only" :db/id 17592186323981} {:answer/id #uuid "28aad101-ebf9-5652-a618-12a2e78b26b4" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$V$ only" :db/id 17592186324299} {:answer/id #uuid "7cbbcfb2-f029-5521-a558-11ba7ecedff0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "None of the sets is orthonormal" :db/id 17592186325024} {:answer/id #uuid "b83eb9dd-838a-5020-af06-544baceb90c8" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$U$ and $V$ only" :db/id 17592186325553} {:answer/id #uuid "d664ac18-d561-5a2d-af86-569af5c3b11b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$U$ only" :db/id 17592186325836}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d664ac18-d561-5a2d-af86-569af5c3b11b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$U$ only" :db/id 17592186325836} :answer-field/id #uuid "222ca2dd-97c8-5d1c-884a-f2cd4980a1a1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186326278}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/problem "Which of the following sets are orthonormal?

- $U={\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix},\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}}$
- $V={\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 0\end{bmatrix},\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}}$
- $W={\begin{bmatrix}\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \\ -\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}\end{bmatrix},\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}}$" :question/worked-solution "Let's denote the vectors of the given sets as 
${{u}_{1},{u}_{2}},$
${{v}_{1},{v}_{2}},$ and 
${{w}_{1},{w}_{2}}$, respectively. 

The sets $U,V,$ and $W$ are orthonormal if the following conditions on each set hold:

- ${u}_{1}\cdot {u}_{2}=0\,\text{and}\,{\begin{aligned}{u}_{1}\cdot {u}_{1}=1 \\ {u}_{2}\cdot {u}_{2}=1.\end{aligned}$

- ${v}_{1}\cdot {v}_{2}=0\,\text{and}\,{\begin{aligned}{v}_{1}\cdot {v}_{1}=1 \\ {v}_{2}\cdot {v}_{2}=1.\end{aligned}$

- ${w}_{1}\cdot {w}_{2}=0\,\text{and}\,{\begin{aligned}{w}_{1}\cdot {w}_{1}=1 \\ {w}_{2}\cdot {w}_{2}=1.\end{aligned}$

With that in mind, let's examine our sets in turn.

- For the set $U,$ we get the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{u}_{1}\cdot {u}_{2} & =\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}\cdot \begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}=0+0=0 & ✓ \\ {u}_{1}\cdot {u}_{1} & =\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}\cdot \begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}=1+0=1 & ✓ \\ {u}_{2}\cdot {u}_{2} & =\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}\cdot \begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}=0+1=1 & ✓\end{aligned}
$$

So, the set $U$ is orthonormal.

- For the set $V,$ notice that

$$
\begin{aligned}{v}_{1}\cdot {v}_{1} & =\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}\cdot \begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}=0+0=0\ne 1 & \times \end{aligned}
$$

So, $V$ is not an orthonormal set.

- For the set $W,$ notice that

$$
\begin{aligned}{w}_{1}\cdot {w}_{2} & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \\ -\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}\end{bmatrix}\cdot \begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}=0-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}=-\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}\ne 0 & \times \end{aligned}
$$

So, $W$ is not an orthonormal set.

Therefore, we conclude that the correct answer is "$U$ only"."} {:db/id 17592186272106 :question/id #uuid "2d09c8cc-56af-54e4-b26f-33ef3a4b7c45" :question/math-academy-id "q-140483"} {:db/id 17592186272107 :question/id #uuid "762f53a4-6eba-533a-aefb-847dcb22ecb6" :question/math-academy-id "q-140484" :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186133781 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ed5c8af7-e617-5e8c-be01-45a26eb17d4d" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Sets are Orthonormal"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "97ee4807-0768-5dc5-aeb6-4da0e5622499" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464120} {:answer/id #uuid "867eac9d-8432-5a6b-a7e2-86a32542c8cb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186464121}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "867eac9d-8432-5a6b-a7e2-86a32542c8cb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186464121} :answer-field/id #uuid "38be1c21-f6e9-54d4-9142-3c32d41421a3" :answer-field/key "U" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186464994} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11b479a3-7665-5809-93c8-9923bd9dd078" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464122} {:answer/id #uuid "0434d7ec-2c3f-5911-b5ee-e68fee2943f5" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186464123}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "11b479a3-7665-5809-93c8-9923bd9dd078" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464122} :answer-field/id #uuid "d7fe6036-bc87-5e27-87c6-c994de7b29fc" :answer-field/key "V" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186464995} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6e7f0ef-5080-5bcb-a31e-245444bb3767" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464124} {:answer/id #uuid "8a380d84-b266-5704-bc8b-eadf0657fcbc" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186464125}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c6e7f0ef-5080-5bcb-a31e-245444bb3767" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464124} :answer-field/id #uuid "988bc0b9-cec8-5860-8c76-531f6f5c225e" :answer-field/key "W" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186464996}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/problem "Which of the following sets are orthonormal?
- **U.** $U={\begin{bmatrix}\frac{2}{\sqrt{13}} \\ -\frac{3}{\sqrt{13}}\end{bmatrix},\begin{bmatrix}\frac{3}{\sqrt{13}} \\ \frac{2}{\sqrt{13}}\end{bmatrix}}$
