{f}^{″}(a)={\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}}_{x=a}
$$

In this case, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂f}{∂x} & \frac{∂f}{∂y}\end{bmatrix}, & \,{f}^{″}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Calculating the first derivative, we have

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}\operatorname{cos}⁡y+y\operatorname{cos}⁡x & \operatorname{sin}⁡x-x\operatorname{sin}⁡y\end{bmatrix}.\end{aligned}
$$

Calculating the second derivative, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}-y\operatorname{sin}⁡x & \operatorname{cos}⁡x-\operatorname{sin}⁡y \\ \operatorname{cos}⁡x-\operatorname{sin}⁡y & -x\operatorname{cos}⁡y\end{bmatrix} \\ {f}^{″}(\frac{\pi }{2},0) & =\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\ 0 & -\frac{\pi }{2}\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, the second-degree Taylor polynomial is given by

$$
f(x)≈f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a)+\frac{1}{2}{\begin{bmatrix}x-\frac{\pi }{2} \\ y\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\ 0 & -\frac{\pi }{2}\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x-\frac{\pi }{2} \\ y\end{bmatrix}.
$$

Finally, the sum of the missing expressions is

$$
(x-\frac{\pi }{2})+(-\frac{\pi }{2})+(x-\frac{\pi }{2})=2x-\frac{3\pi }{2}.
$$"} :step/id #uuid "754b4ab2-0c61-518a-8fe4-5c04a479e6df" :step/next {:db/id 17592186498643}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0488d7ff-b23d-57ca-ac1f-3b003b1d4cad" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "x-2\pi " :db/id 17592186278628} {:answer/id #uuid "19abce14-7fbc-5539-b049-f6588065cc58" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2x-\frac{3\pi }{2}" :db/id 17592186278820} {:answer/id #uuid "1b20a70e-e52e-59a8-a425-efc1714f3b05" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2x" :db/id 17592186278843} {:answer/id #uuid "4be49a5e-04bf-5a10-ba8f-0ff99825ca37" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "x-\frac{\pi }{2}" :db/id 17592186279271} {:answer/id #uuid "f7c391e8-39ad-5fb2-9766-ec1eb8cec68c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2x-\pi " :db/id 17592186280763}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186278820} :answer-field/id #uuid "11825cc6-3e2c-51ee-8c64-1a71cc1b22e6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186280861} {:answer/id #uuid "0488d7ff-b23d-57ca-ac1f-3b003b1d4cad" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "x-2\pi " :db/id 17592186278628} {:answer/id #uuid "19abce14-7fbc-5539-b049-f6588065cc58" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2x-\frac{3\pi }{2}" :db/id 17592186278820} {:answer/id #uuid "1b20a70e-e52e-59a8-a425-efc1714f3b05" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2x" :db/id 17592186278843} {:answer/id #uuid "4be49a5e-04bf-5a10-ba8f-0ff99825ca37" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "x-\frac{\pi }{2}" :db/id 17592186279271} {:answer/id #uuid "f7c391e8-39ad-5fb2-9766-ec1eb8cec68c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2x-\pi " :db/id 17592186280763} {:db/id 17592186498643 :step/content {:db/id 17592186281610 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08d4caa4-4beb-5879-be0e-2ecd7839fde6" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2y+6e-2" :db/id 17592186278675} {:answer/id #uuid "673f89a5-8bcd-52d1-a51d-1e9b6862c990" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2y+6" :db/id 17592186279527} {:answer/id #uuid "8518450c-6a7d-5908-8248-9d4d5e973d4a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "x+y-3" :db/id 17592186279786} {:answer/id #uuid "e00a9b9b-e6c8-5944-9c02-0f2375033954" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2y+10e-4" :db/id 17592186280570} {:answer/id #uuid "f4e66d77-2537-5e67-9679-68844748ea83" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "x+y+10e" :db/id 17592186280737}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186280570} :answer-field/id #uuid "55491170-a6a3-5d0f-aeb5-a0ffe8175fa2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186280975}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "61a1651c-7c64-5ebe-93b5-ec0cfeb0b0a9" :question/math-academy-id "q-163144" :question/problem "For the function $f:{R}^{2}\to R,$ defined as

$$
f(x,y)={e}^{3x-y},
$$

the quadratic Taylor polynomial of $f$ about $a=\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 2\end{bmatrix}$ is given by

$$
f(x)≈∗+\begin{bmatrix}∗ & -e\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ ∗\end{bmatrix}+\frac{1}{2}{\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ ∗\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\ -3e & e\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ y-2\end{bmatrix}.
$$

Find the sum of the six missing expressions." :question/worked-solution "Suppose that the function $f:{R}^{n}\to R$ is defened by 

$$
f:\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\ {x}_{2} \\ ⋮ \\ {x}_{n}\end{bmatrix}⟶z
$$



and is twice differentiable at $x=a.$ Then, the quadratic Taylor polynomial of $f$ about $a$ is given by

$$
\begin{aligned}f(x) & ≈f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a)+\frac{1}{2}(x-a)^{T}{f}^{″}(a)(x-a),\end{aligned}
$$

where

$$
{f}^{′}(a)={\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{n}}\end{bmatrix}|}_{x=a}
$$

and

$$
{f}^{″}(a)={\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}}_{x=a}
$$

In this case, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂f}{∂x} & \frac{∂f}{∂y}\end{bmatrix}, & \,{f}^{″}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Now, we compute the terms of our Taylor polynomial:

- Calculating the value of the function, we have

$$
\begin{aligned}f(1,2) & =e.\end{aligned}
$$

- Calculating the first derivatives, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}3{e}^{3x-y} & -{e}^{3x-y}\end{bmatrix} \\ {f}^{′}(1,2) & =\begin{bmatrix}3e & -e\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

- Calculating the second derivative, we have the following:

$$
\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\begin{bmatrix}9{e}^{3x-y} & -3{e}^{3x-y} \\ -3{e}^{3x-y} & {e}^{3x-y}\end{bmatrix} \\ {f}^{″}(1,2) & =\begin{bmatrix}9e & -3e \\ -3e & e\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, the second-degree Taylor polynomial is given by

$$
f(x)≈e+\begin{bmatrix}3e & -e\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ y-2\end{bmatrix}+\frac{1}{2}{\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ y-2\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\begin{bmatrix}9e & -3e \\ -3e & e\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ y-2\end{bmatrix}
$$

Finally, the sum of the missing expressions is

$$
e+3e+(y-2)+(y-2)+9e+(-3e)=2y+10e-4.
$$"} :step/id #uuid "a67dda22-3935-5689-915a-87b3021a1579" :step/next {:db/id 17592186498634}} {:db/id 17592186498634 :step/content {:db/id 17592186284521 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "600bf2e3-6ccc-5e19-9c6d-a11e065651ca" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id 17592186282503} {:answer/id #uuid "88308563-47ab-55ac-b349-b96b91b0c069" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2" :db/id 17592186282861} {:answer/id #uuid "90dcefcb-039e-53fd-ad50-070bdaeaeafe" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id 17592186282943} {:answer/id #uuid "e899ed7d-bdce-5f3e-8857-e9c5204e70b0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "6" :db/id 17592186283714} {:answer/id #uuid "f88eee42-846c-5f36-8d70-74d6ce1e4b22" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "3" :db/id 17592186283865}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186282943} :answer-field/id #uuid "9bee6918-a74e-5833-a9b9-7d8fc82fe9ec" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186284203}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "f42addea-156e-5dc2-b6d9-50bdb56ae67d" :question/math-academy-id "q-164827" :question/problem "For the twice-differentiable function $f:{R}^{2}\to R,$ we have the following data:

$$
