$$

Use the quadratic Taylor polynomial of $f$ about $a=\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}$ to approximate the value of $f(0,2).$" :question/worked-solution "Suppose that the function $f:{R}^{n}\to R$ is defined by 

$$
f:\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\ {x}_{2} \\ ⋮ \\ {x}_{n}\end{bmatrix}⟶z
$$



and is twice differentiable at $x=a.$ Then, the quadratic Taylor polynomial of $f$ about $a$ is given by

$$
\begin{aligned}f(x) & ≈f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a)+\frac{1}{2}(x-a)^{T}{f}^{″}(a)(x-a),\end{aligned}
$$

where

$$
{f}^{′}(a)={\begin{bmatrix}\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{n}}\end{bmatrix}|}_{x=a}
$$

and

$$
{f}^{″}(a)={\begin{bmatrix}\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\ \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\end{bmatrix}}_{x=a}
$$

In this case, we have $a=\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 1\end{bmatrix},$ and the following data:

$$
\begin{aligned}f(a) & =2, & \,{f}^{′}(a) & =\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1\end{bmatrix}, & \,{f}^{″}(a) & =\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\ 3 & 0\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, the second-degree Taylor polynomial is given by

$$
f(x)≈2+\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ y-1\end{bmatrix}+\frac{1}{2}{\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ y-1\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\ 3 & 0\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}x-1 \\ y-1\end{bmatrix}
$$

Finally, evaluating the polynomial at $x=\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 2\end{bmatrix},$ we obtain

$$
\begin{aligned}f(0,2) & ≈2+\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}0-1 \\ 2-1\end{bmatrix}+\frac{1}{2}{\begin{bmatrix}0-1 \\ 2-1\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\ 3 & 0\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}0-1 \\ 2-1\end{bmatrix} \\  & =2+\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}+\frac{1}{2}{\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\ 3 & 0\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\ 1\end{bmatrix} \\  & =2+(-2)+\frac{1}{2}\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\ -3\end{bmatrix} \\  & =0+\frac{1}{2}(0) \\  & =0.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "7ae3c717-af7e-5f78-a5cd-4c69f63eb716" :step/next {:db/id 17592186498618}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "600bf2e3-6ccc-5e19-9c6d-a11e065651ca" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id 17592186282503} {:answer/id #uuid "88308563-47ab-55ac-b349-b96b91b0c069" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2" :db/id 17592186282861} {:answer/id #uuid "90dcefcb-039e-53fd-ad50-070bdaeaeafe" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id 17592186282943} {:answer/id #uuid "e899ed7d-bdce-5f3e-8857-e9c5204e70b0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "6" :db/id 17592186283714} {:answer/id #uuid "f88eee42-846c-5f36-8d70-74d6ce1e4b22" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "3" :db/id 17592186283865}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186282943} :answer-field/id #uuid "9bee6918-a74e-5833-a9b9-7d8fc82fe9ec" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186284203} {:answer/id #uuid "600bf2e3-6ccc-5e19-9c6d-a11e065651ca" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id 17592186282503} {:answer/id #uuid "88308563-47ab-55ac-b349-b96b91b0c069" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2" :db/id 17592186282861} {:answer/id #uuid "90dcefcb-039e-53fd-ad50-070bdaeaeafe" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id 17592186282943} {:answer/id #uuid "e899ed7d-bdce-5f3e-8857-e9c5204e70b0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "6" :db/id 17592186283714} {:answer/id #uuid "f88eee42-846c-5f36-8d70-74d6ce1e4b22" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "3" :db/id 17592186283865} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "40a5e6d9-c4fd-57bb-8147-cf98861b9d12" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "1-3x" :db/id 17592186367813} {:answer/id #uuid "1719c348-9c4f-5f66-9ae0-a4eafaef1b2c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2-x" :db/id 17592186367814} {:answer/id #uuid "e8f81270