\begin{aligned}{\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s & ={\int }_{{\theta }_{1}}^{{\theta }_{2}}\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}\sqrt{{(2+2\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta )}^{2}+{(-2\operatorname{sin}⁡\theta )}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}\sqrt{4+8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta +4{cos}^{2}⁡\theta +4{sin}^{2}⁡\theta }\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & =\sqrt{8}{\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}\sqrt{1+\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta }\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & =\sqrt{8}{\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}\sqrt{2}\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{\theta }{2})\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & =8\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{\theta }{2}){|}_{0}^{\pi /2} \\  & =8(\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{\pi }{4})-\operatorname{sin}⁡0) \\  & =4\sqrt{2}\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "748e2a73-740f-5666-bb51-de197b0e3f99" :step/next {:db/id 17592186483506}} {:db/id 17592186483454 :step/content {:db/id 17592186483352 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d1c4079-2e4b-58ce-bcdd-cef5dccc4c25" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{\theta }\sqrt{2{\theta }^{2}+2\theta +1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482832} {:answer/id #uuid "2dfd78b7-9d7a-58b9-8cb4-d7bec505415d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{\theta {e}^{\theta }+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482890} {:answer/id #uuid "33feb924-d253-5720-9471-b530f5057780" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{\theta }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482903} {:answer/id #uuid "4170ee29-2690-59a0-ac02-7ef811bc4abc" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}{e}^{2\theta }+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482922} {:answer/id #uuid "42a9d64f-13f1-500c-89f4-8b8e1616488f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{2\theta }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}+2}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482925}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186482832} :answer-field/id #uuid "a8b124e2-32da-5651-8541-39b8419c32ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186483305}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "22b679e5-bd2f-5f85-b6e8-97dc0feb70a5" :question/math-academy-id "q-149799" :question/problem "Which of the following is equivalent to ${\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the path along the polar curve $r=\theta {e}^{\theta }\,$ for $0\le \theta \le \pi \,?$" :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,

$$
{\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s=L.
$$

In polar coordinates, the arc length element $\text{d}s$ is given by

$$
\text{d}s=\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta .
$$

So, for a polar curve defined as $r=r(\theta )$ for ${\theta }_{1}\le \theta \le {\theta }_{2},$ we have

$$
L={\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s={\int }_{{\theta }_{1}}^{{\theta }_{2}}\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta .
$$

Since $r=\theta {e}^{\theta },$ we have

$$
\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta }=(1+\theta ){e}^{\theta }.
$$

Therefore, the expression for our line integral is

$$
\begin{aligned}{\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s & ={\int }_{{\theta }_{1}}^{{\theta }_{2}}\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{{(\theta {e}^{\theta })}^{2}+{((1+\theta ){e}^{\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}{e}^{2\theta }+(1+\theta )^{2}{e}^{2\theta }}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{{e}^{2\theta }({\theta }^{2}+1+2\theta +{\theta }^{2})}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{\theta }\sqrt{2{\theta }^{2}+2\theta +1}\,\text{d}\theta .\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "3c48a8d6-bb4a-559a-912c-74a8d59f12d8" :step/next {:db/id 17592186483472}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d1c4079-2e4b-58ce-bcdd-cef5dccc4c25" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{\theta }\sqrt{2{\theta }^{2}+2\theta +1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482832} {:answer/id #uuid "2dfd78b7-9d7a-58b9-8cb4-d7bec505415d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{\theta {e}^{\theta }+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482890} {:answer/id #uuid "33feb924-d253-5720-9471-b530f5057780" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{\theta }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482903} {:answer/id #uuid "4170ee29-2690-59a0-ac02-7ef811bc4abc" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}{e}^{2\theta }+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482922} {:answer/id #uuid "42a9d64f-13f1-500c-89f4-8b8e1616488f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{2\theta }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}+2}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482925}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186482832} :answer-field/id #uuid "a8b124e2-32da-5651-8541-39b8419c32ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186483305} {:answer/id #uuid "0d1c4079-2e4b-58ce-bcdd-cef5dccc4c25" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{\theta }\sqrt{2{\theta }^{2}+2\theta +1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482832} {:answer/id #uuid "2dfd78b7-9d7a-58b9-8cb4-d7bec505415d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{\theta {e}^{\theta }+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482890} {:answer/id #uuid "33feb924-d253-5720-9471-b530f5057780" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{\theta }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482903} {:answer/id #uuid "4170ee29-2690-59a0-ac02-7ef811bc4abc" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}{e}^{2\theta }+1}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482922} {:answer/id #uuid "42a9d64f-13f1-500c-89f4-8b8e1616488f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{e}^{2\theta }\sqrt{{\theta }^{2}+2}\,\text{d}\theta " :db/id 17592186482925} {:db/id 17592186483472 :step/content {:db/id 17592186483419 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "614ec109-ddf5-5d69-8b6f-788cffd7d795" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{3\pi }{4}" :db/id 17592186482983} {:answer/id #uuid "654af1d0-1b91-562a-9226-854b3fe81f62" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{2\pi }{3}" :db/id 17592186482990} {:answer/id #uuid "6bec234f-7e3b-515c-a2ad-33a2c8025357" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "3\pi " :db/id 17592186482999} {:answer/id #uuid "960e21ae-a0b1-56a4-a8e3-7aa555730f7a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{3\pi }{2}" :db/id 17592186483072} {:answer/id #uuid "c60010fa-7943-5d78-8597-6d6fec062ebb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2\pi " :db/id 17592186483143}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186482983} :answer-field/id #uuid "87114391-cb4d-5092-83cc-b2e18baed326" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186483291}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "dcd1fd46-503a-5471-9362-496d88e411cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-149819" :question/problem "![](images/c7/c700a13da4a3b21940ec6268a89670eee850fc6206285bd3b444959a8b386276.png)

Calculate ${\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the path along the polar curve $r={cos}^{3}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})$ for $0\le \theta \le \frac{3\pi }{2},$ shown above." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,

$$
{\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s=L.
$$

In polar coordinates, the arc length element $\text{d}s$ is given by

$$
\text{d}s=\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta .
$$

So, for a polar curve defined as $r=r(\theta )$ for ${\theta }_{1}\le \theta \le {\theta }_{2},$ we have

$$
L={\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s={\int }_{{\theta }_{1}}^{{\theta }_{2}}\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta .
$$

Since $r={cos}^{3}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3}),$ we have

$$
\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta }=-\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3}){cos}^{2}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3}).
$$

Therefore, we evaluate our line integral as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}{\int }_{C}\,\text{d}s & ={\int }_{{\theta }_{1}}^{{\theta }_{2}}\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\frac{\text{d}r}{\text{d}\theta })}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{3\pi /2}\sqrt{{({cos}^{3}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3}))}^{2}+{(-\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3}){cos}^{2}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3}))}^{2}}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{3\pi /2}\sqrt{{cos}^{6}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})+{sin}^{2}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3}){cos}^{4}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{3\pi /2}\sqrt{{cos}^{4}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})[{cos}^{2}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})+{sin}^{2}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})]}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{3\pi /2}\sqrt{{cos}^{4}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})}\,\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{3\pi /2}{cos}^{2}⁡(\frac{\theta }{3})\text{d}\theta  \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{3\pi /2}\frac{1}{2}[1+\operatorname{cos}⁡(\frac{2\theta }{3})]\text{d}\theta  \\  & =\frac{1}{2}{[\theta +\frac{3}{2}\operatorname{sin}⁡(\frac{2\theta }{3})]}_{0}^{3\pi /2} \\  & =\frac{3\pi }{4}.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "73aaaa88-a71a-530e-8d01-e165dd7e3bfc"} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "614ec109-ddf5-5d69-8b6f-788cffd7d795" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{3\pi }{4}" :db/id 17592186482983} {:answer/id #uuid "654af1d0-1b91-562a-9226-854b3fe81f62" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{2\pi }{3}" :db/id 17592186482990} {:answer/id #uuid "6bec234f-7e3b-515c-a2ad-33a2c8025357" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "3\pi " :db/id 17592186482999} {:answer/id #uuid "960e21ae-a0b1-56a4-a8e3-7aa555730f7a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{3\pi }{2}" :db/id 17592186483072} {:answer/id #uuid "c60010fa-7943-5d78-8597-6d6fec062ebb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2\pi " :db/id 17592186483143}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186482983} :answer-field/id #uuid "87114391-cb4d-5092-83cc-b2e18baed326" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186483291} {:answer/id #uuid "614ec109-ddf5-5d69-8b6f-788cffd7d795" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{3\pi }{4}" :db/id 17592186482983} {:answer/id #uuid "654af1d0-1b91-562a-9226-854b3fe81f62" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{2\pi }{3}" :db/id 17592186482990} {:answer/id #uuid "6bec234f-7e3b-515c-a2ad-33a2c8025357" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "3\pi " :db/id 17592186482999} {:answer/id #uuid "960e21ae-a0b1-56a4-a8e3-7aa555730f7a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{3\pi }{2}" :db/id 17592186483072} {:answer/id #uuid "c60010fa-7943-5d78-8597-6d6fec062ebb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2\pi " :db/id 17592186483143} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "500ad374-633d-5acc-8fc6-2c954b7ceee0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{3\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id 17592186482954} {:answer/id #uuid "7daf2602-5ddf-5b93-9c8f-85bf86b1183f" :answer/type {:db/id 175921