$$
f(x)≈1+\frac{1}{2}(x-a)^{T}\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 3 \\ 3 & -6\end{bmatrix}(x-a).
$$

Given that the eigenvalues of ${f}^{″}(a)$ are ${\lambda }_{1}=-3$ and ${\lambda }_{2}=-9,$ what type of point is $a?$" :question/worked-solution "The point $a\in {R}^{n}$ is a critical point of the function $f:{R}^{n}\to R$ if ${f}^{′}(a)={0}^{T}.$ In such cases, we can classify $a$ as follows:

- if ${f}^{″}(a)$ is positive definite, then $a$ is a local minimum

- if ${f}^{″}(a)$ is negative definite, then $a$ is a local maximum

- if ${f}^{″}(a)$ is neither positive-definite nor negative-definite, then $a$ is a saddle point

The quadratic Taylor expansion of a function $f:{R}^{n}\to R$ about $x=a\in {R}^{n}$ given by

$$
f(x)≈f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a)+\frac{1}{2}(x-a)^{T}{f}^{″}(a)(x-a).
$$

Since the quadratic Taylor expansion of $f$ has no $(x-a)$ term, we can conclude that ${f}^{′}(a)={0}^{T}.$ Hence, $a$ is a critical point of $f.$

Finally, notice that both the eigenvalues of ${f}^{″}(a)$ are negative:

$$
\begin{aligned}{\lambda }_{1} & =-3<0 \\ {\lambda }_{2} & =-9<0\end{aligned}
$$

So, the matrix is negative definite. Therefore, $a$ is a local maximum of $f.$"} :step/id #uuid "40399da2-21fd-5f08-bac2-f30a1d0cf8b3" :step/next {:db/id 17592186445203}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "99f22169-b8a2-5fb3-aca1-3e5599415ad8" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "local maximum" :db/id 17592186367876} {:answer/id #uuid "abbaa7f2-5259-5b5a-bebd-07f255b181e9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "inconclusive" :db/id 17592186367877} {:answer/id #uuid "f674340e-9bc4-5748-9997-f0404db95ca2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "not a critical point" :db/id 17592186367878} {:answer/id #uuid "383240c1-34bf-5387-adaf-b9355e4cf27e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "local minimum" :db/id 17592186367879} {:answer/id #uuid "0e483432-9f14-537e-b0dd-61a175cc1645" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "saddle point" :db/id 17592186367880}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186367876} :answer-field/id #uuid "be669623-0526-55a8-9e58-06217378cfec" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186367875} {:answer/id #uuid "99f22169-b8a2-5fb3-aca1-3e5599415ad8" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "local maximum" :db/id 17592186367876} {:answer/id #uuid "abbaa7f2-5259-5b5a-bebd-07f255b181e9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "inconclusive" :db/id 17592186367877} {:answer/id #uuid "f674340e-9bc4-5748-9997-f0404db95ca2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "not a critical point" :db/id 17592186367878} {:answer/id #uuid "383240c1-34bf-5387-adaf-b9355e4cf27e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "local minimum" :db/id 17592186367879} {:answer/id #uuid "0e483432-9f14-537e-b0dd-61a175cc1645" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "saddle point" :db/id 17592186367880} {:db/id 17592186445203 :step/content {:db/id 17592186401439 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id