\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442236} {:answer/id #uuid "bd4d50f5-796c-5fc2-a622-14130e42fc0e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "9\operatorname{sin}⁡t\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442241} {:answer/id #uuid "e911610a-7c47-5303-9138-bd0e5e56ae76" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-9{sin}^{2}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442244}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186442235} :answer-field/id #uuid "f5a72b7a-4d2b-5cb1-bfa9-dcf075591732" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186442248}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "6653118e-2998-5812-b728-f3217528d405" :question/math-academy-id "q-126746" :question/problem "![](images/0a/0a60729b626e1e9e219a839898cacc18aa81ec2a9b1b445e7b92b721874c2550.png)

Let $D$ be the region enclosed by the curve $C$ parametrized as
$r(t)=⟨3\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\,3\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩$ for $t\in [0,2\pi ].$ The area of $D$ can be written as

$$
\text{Area}(D)={∬}_{D}(\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\frac{∂P}{∂y})dA={\int }_{0}^{2\pi }\boxed{}\,dt,
$$

where $P(x,y)=0$ and $Q(x,y)=x.$ Determine the missing part of the equation." :question/worked-solution "Our simple, smooth, closed path $C$ is positively oriented, and  

$$
\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\frac{∂P}{∂y}=1-0=1.
$$

So, according to Green's theorem, we can write the area of the region $D$ enclosed by the curve $C$ as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}\text{Area}(D) & ={∬}_{D}\text{d}A \\  & ={∬}_{D}(\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\frac{∂P}{∂y})\text{d}A \\  & ={∮}_{C}P\,\text{d}x+Q\,\text{d}y\end{aligned}
$$



Substituting $P(x,y)=0$ and $Q(x,y)=x,$ we get

$$
{∮}_{C}P\,\text{d}x+Q\,\text{d}y={∮}_{C}x\,\text{d}y.
$$



The derivative of $r(t)$ is

$$
{r}^{′}(t)=⟨-3\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\,3\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩.
$$

Therefore, we can write our line integral as

$$
\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}x\,dy & ={\int }_{0}^{2\pi }3\operatorname{cos}⁡t\cdot 3\operatorname{cos}⁡t\,dt \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{2\pi }9{cos}^{2}⁡t\,dt.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "db95ffdd-3589-5fdd-806c-5051d2294931" :step/next {:db/id 17592186442255}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14451dd1-51ba-5cb4-a62a-0a5d4ff055bf" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "9{sin}^{2}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442227} {:answer/id #uuid "6f80c7b4-33fd-57db-876b-025e20021ccd" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "9{cos}^{2}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442235} {:answer/id #uuid "81dd9c9a-88ed-5edc-bb4a-ab112606e4e5" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-9\operatorname{sin}⁡t\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442236} {:answer/id #uuid "bd4d50f5-796c-5fc2-a622-14130e42fc0e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "9\operatorname{sin}⁡t\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442241} {:answer/id #uuid "e911610a-7c47-5303-9138-bd0e5e56ae76" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-9{sin}^{2}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442244}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186442235} :answer-field/id #uuid "f5a72b7a-4d2b-5cb1-bfa9-dcf075591732" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186442248} {:answer/id #uuid "14451dd1-51ba-5cb4-a62a-0a5d4ff055bf" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "9{sin}^{2}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442227} {:answer/id #uuid "6f80c7b4-33fd-57db-876b-025e20021ccd" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "9{cos}^{2}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442235} {:answer/id #uuid "81dd9c9a-88ed-5edc-bb4a-ab112606e4e5" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-9\operatorname{sin}⁡t\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442236} {:answer/id #uuid "bd4d50f5-796c-5fc2-a622-14130e42fc0e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "9\operatorname{sin}⁡t\operatorname{cos}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442241} {:answer/id #uuid "e911610a-7c47-5303-9138-bd0e5e56ae76" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-9{sin}^{2}⁡t" :db/id 17592186442244} {:db/id 17592186162041 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id 17592186161835 :question/id #u