</table>" :question/worked-solution "Recall that if  $A=UΣ{V}^{T}$ is a singular value decomposition of a $3\times 2$ matrix $A,$ then

- $Σ$ is a $3\times 2$ matrix with nonnegative elements on the main diagonal and zeroes outside the main diagonal,

- $U$ is an orthogonal $3\times 3$ matrix,

- $V$ is an orthogonal $2\times 2$ matrix.

From the matrix $Σ,$ we deduce that ${\sigma }_{1}=2\sqrt{5}$ and ${\sigma }_{2}=0.$
Also, the columns ${v}_{1}$ and ${v}_{2}$ of $V$ give us the right singular vectors of $A.$

Therefore, we can compute the first column of $U$ as follows:

$$
\begin{aligned}{u}_{1} & =\frac{1}{{\sigma }_{1}}A{v}_{1} \\  & =\frac{1}{2\sqrt{5}}\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 \\ 4 & 0\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix} \\  & =\frac{1}{2\sqrt{5}}\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\ 0 \\ 4\end{bmatrix} \\  & =\begin{bmatrix}-\frac{1}{\sqrt{5}} \\ 0 \\ \frac{2}{\sqrt{5}}\end{bmatrix}\end{aligned}
$$

Since the second singular value is ${\sigma }_{2}=0$, and we do not have the third singular value, we can't use the same formula to find the second and third columns of $U.$ But we know that $U$ must be orthogonal. Hence, we must find vectors 

$$
u=\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\ {x}_{2} \\ {x}_{3}\end{bmatrix}
$$

such that ${u}_{1}\cdot u=0$ and $‖u‖=1.$

Solving ${u}_{1}\cdot u=0,$ which is equivalent to

$$
-\frac{1}{\sqrt{5}}{x}_{1}+\frac{2}{\sqrt{5}}{x}_{3}=0\,⟹\,-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{3}=0,
$$

we get the general solution 

$$
\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{3} \\ {x}_{2} \\ {x}_{3}\end{bmatrix}={x}_{2}{{\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}}_{⏟}}_{{b}_{1}}+{x}_{3}{{\begin{bmatrix}2 \\ 0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}}_{⏟}}_{{b}_{2}},
$$

where ${x}_{2}$ and ${x}_{3}$ are free variables.

Notice that the two linearly independent solutions ${b}_{1}$ and ${b}_{2}$ are mutually orthogonal. Therefore, we only need to normalize them. This gives the second and third columns of $U:$   

$$
{u}_{2}=\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1 \\ 0\end{bmatrix}\,{u}_{3}=\begin{bmatrix}\frac{2}{\sqrt{5}} \\ 0 \\ \frac{1}{\sqrt{5}}\end{bmatrix}
$$

So, the matrix $U$ could be the following:

$$
U=\begin{bmatrix}-\frac{1}{\sqrt{5}} & 0 & \frac{2}{\sqrt{5}} \\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\ \frac{2}{\sqrt{5}} & 0 & \frac{1}{\sqrt{5}}\end{bmatrix}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "16918a72-6401-5b9a-b63c-2cb335c81055" :step/next {:db/id 17592186505851}} {:db/id 17592186505851 :step/content {:db/id 17592186423858 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1bb23bb5-3483-5614-b88a-de724eaace0f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\frac{1}{\sqrt{5}}" :db/id 17592186423688} {:answer/id #uuid "632a3226-0edc-509f-99a3-4d9c96f743ee" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id 17592186423729} {:answer/id #uuid "7218d9af-95a8-55cf-800f-61814c401415" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{1}{\sqrt{5}}" :db/id 17592186423741} {:answer/id #uuid "ac9e14f5-017e-56b0-8dc0-4c4f65c61b7b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{2}{\sqrt{5}}" :db/id 17592186423774}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186423729} :answer-field/id #uuid "14410804-799e-56d0-9d89-7e2196853f56" :answer-field/key "field-8" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045494} :db/id 17592186423824} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "58116699-dc0e-5875-8617-121d3e8874d4" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=0" :db/id 17592186423719} {:answer/id #uuid "9c42c3c4-2aba-5894-96bd-2074694edbd4" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=0" :db/id 17592186423763} {:answer/id #uuid "c267c1c4-add4-5231-a874-6fcfa0f47fee" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=0" :db/id 17592186423786}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186423719} :answer-field/id #uuid "7e151b3c-d415-573c-81b7-688b8b302f25" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045494} :db/id 17592186423835} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2fb670b5-3601-5df0-b1aa-074dca4385e9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "2" :db/id 17592186423701} {:answer/id #uuid "41b4239d-10cd-5ed8-87ad-d834584346c8" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "-4" :db/id 175921864237