over the region $R$ enclosed inside the sphere ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=4$ for $y\le 0$ and $z\le 0,$ shown above." :question/worked-solution "We will use the change of variables formula in the form

$$
{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\,dV={∭}_{Δ}\,f(\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)\,{\rho }^{2}\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ.
$$

If $(\rho ,\theta ,ϕ)$ are the spherical coordinates of a point, then its Cartesian coordinates $(x,y,z)$ can be found by using the following formulas:

$$
x=\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\,y=\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\,z=\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ
$$

Notice that the region $R$ represents one-quarter of the sphere of radius $2$ centered at the origin.

![](images/09/090f210768ffd4a6be529860b54a2906e265427b7d85bcbb07e3101c801740ba.png)



As a result, we obtain that in spherical polar coordinates, our region can be expressed as 

$$
Δ=\{(\rho ,\theta ,ϕ)\,:\,0\le \rho \le 2,\,\pi \le \theta \le 2\pi ,\,\frac{\pi }{2}\le ϕ\le \pi \}.
$$

Next, we substitute the spherical polar coordinates into the function $f(x,y,z)={({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2})}^{2}:$

$$
\begin{aligned}f(x,y,z) & =f(\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ) \\  & ={({\rho }^{2})}^{2} \\  & ={\rho }^{4}\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain

$$
\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}{({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2})}^{2}\,\text{d}V & ={∭}_{Δ}{\rho }^{4}\cdot {\rho }^{2}\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ \\  & ={\int }_{\pi /2}^{\pi }{\int }_{\pi }^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2}{\rho }^{6}\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ \\  & ={\int }_{\pi /2}^{\pi }\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,dϕ\cdot {\int }_{\pi }^{2\pi }d\theta \cdot {\int }_{0}^{2}{\rho }^{6}\,d\rho  \\  & =[-\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ]_{ϕ=\pi /2}^{ϕ=\pi }\cdot [\theta ]_{\theta =\pi }^{\theta =2\pi }\cdot {[\frac{1}{7}{\rho }^{7}]}_{\rho =0}^{\rho =2} \\  & =-(-1-0)\cdot (2\pi -\pi )\cdot \frac{1}{7}(128-0) \\  & =1\cdot \pi \cdot \frac{128}{7} \\  & =\frac{128\pi }{7}\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "8b10d38c-406c-548c-b35d-cf1e229f05a8" :step/next {:db/id 17592186496378}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "021f15c9-f5ca-5fc3-8d40-1a3115937ceb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{128\pi }{7}" :db/id 17592186495513} {:answer/id #uuid "02d47acc-5e12-5a9c-bd05-2023d477bc45" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "25\pi " :db/id 17592186495517} {:answer/id #uuid "18832182-39dc-5364-9464-ffd9aaaa5c09" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{64\pi }{3}" :db/id 17592186495557} {:answer/id #uuid "821f4bda-e9cb-5812-adda-f108cac57aa9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "16\pi " :db/id 17592186495789} {:answer/id #uuid "a4e840a3-e6d2-5b8d-b91c-2840c23ac88b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{81\pi }{4}" :db/id 17592186495881}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186495513} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f2e7f56-ee2d-5dfd-af32-c2c72dce6d2b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186496079} {:answer/id #uuid "021f15c9-f5ca-5fc3-8d40-1a3115937ceb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{128\pi }{7}" :db/id 17592186495513} {:answer/id #uuid "02d47acc-5e12-5a9c-bd05-2023d477bc45" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "25\pi " :db/id 17592186495517} {:answer/id #uuid "18832182-39dc-5364-9464-ffd9aaaa5c09" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{64\pi }{3}" :db/id 17592186495557} {:answer/id #uuid "821f4bda-e9cb-5812-adda-f108cac57aa9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "16\pi " :db/id 17592186495789} {:answer/id #uuid "a4e840a3-e6d2-5b8d-b91c-2840c23ac88b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\frac{81\pi }{4}" :db/id 17592186495881} {:db/id 17592186496378 :step/content {:db/id 17592186496318 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02c3d150-55f6-525d-b55a-6951b89555eb" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "${\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{4\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{sin}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ$ v" :db/id 17592186495516} {:answer/id #uuid "0641edc9-9f46-539c-b517-a7dff5678e4b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{sin}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495527} {:answer/id #uuid "8a7b57ca-d67c-5580-9698-a81cf1ce11e0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{\rho }^{3}{sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495813} {:answer/id #uuid "9a52e985-8c43-591c-a2b1-487e13e3bbcf" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499} :answer/value "${\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ$ v" :db/id 17592186495854} {:answer/id #uuid "b2362d0a-41f0-5512-8b16-672410d72346" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{4\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{\rho }^{3}{sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495912}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186495527} :answer-field/id #uuid "2cbd266d-a5fa-5b3b-84b2-668b33154b73" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186496094}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "e3dbf795-87d9-5ee7-946c-df26586b5ee5" :question/math-academy-id "q-161860" :question/problem "![](images/4d/4d2a71ffdce7f02cdfa78881c7e355c9aada4134cf06b663a2deefb3d779b9ca.png)

The region $R$ is enclosed inside the sphere ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=8x,$ shown above. 
Express the following triple integral in spherical polar coordinates. 

$$
{∭}_{R}y\,\text{d}V
$$" :question/worked-solution "We will use the change of variables formula in the form

$$
{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\,dV={∭}_{Δ}\,f(\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)\,{\rho }^{2}\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ.
$$

If $(\rho ,\theta ,ϕ)$ are the spherical coordinates of a point, then its Cartesian coordinates $(x,y,z)$ can be found by using the following formulas:

$$
x=\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\,y=\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\,z=\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ
$$

Notice that the region $R$ represents the sphere of radius $4$ centered at $(4,0,0).$

With that in mind, let's now write the ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=8x$ in spherical polar coordinates:

$$
\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2} & =8x \\ {\rho }^{2} & =8\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ \\ \rho (\rho -8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ) & =0\end{aligned}
$$



Since $\rho $ cannot be identical to zero on the entire sphere, we must have $\rho =8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ.$

![](images/04/0475e2e272a30318dc4cb31457539a312544b6e14d7e6a8ed3f911d41404b575.png)



As a result, we obtain that in spherical polar coordinates, our region can be expressed as 

$$
Δ=\{(\rho ,\theta ,ϕ)\,:\,0\le \rho \le 8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\,-\frac{\pi }{2}\le \theta \le \frac{\pi }{2},\,0\le ϕ\le \pi \}.
$$

Next, we substitute the spherical polar coordinates into the function $f(x,y,z)=y:$

$$
\begin{aligned}f(x,y,z) & =f(\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ) \\  & =\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain  

$$
\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}y\,\text{d}V & ={∭}_{Δ}\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\cdot {\rho }^{2}\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{8\operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{sin}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "b765debc-aaac-5aa1-af3c-f378ddb7464a"} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a717243-48be-536d-910a-6d83ab68f329" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495536} {:answer/id #uuid "1afd572b-1bde-5282-aebe-538e26120c34" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495564} {:answer/id #uuid "5a35fc1c-68fd-5d54-b891-f97bb27891a2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495714} {:answer/id #uuid "90820d05-7799-52ea-bb46-3e07581e83ec" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495829} {:answer/id #uuid "cf09a2be-f3f1-58fe-aff8-83664e28906f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495963}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186495829} :answer-field/id #uuid "851dbeb9-5199-5c05-92dd-f09fe944b1b4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186496139} {:answer/id #uuid "0a717243-48be-536d-910a-6d83ab68f329" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495536} {:answer/id #uuid "1afd572b-1bde-5282-aebe-538e26120c34" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495564} {:answer/id #uuid "5a35fc1c-68fd-5d54-b891-f97bb27891a2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495714} {:answer/id #uuid "90820d05-7799-52ea-bb46-3e07581e83ec" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495829} {:answer/id #uuid "cf09a2be-f3f1-58fe-aff8-83664e28906f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{-\pi /2}^{\pi /2}{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{3}\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495963} {:db/id 17592186496375 :step/content {:db/id 17592186496299 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19b76607-eca3-5a84-8112-1e82b79c1646" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{cos}^{2}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495561} {:answer/id #uuid "3454506d-b82b-5713-b11f-01ee75904e1f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{4}\operatorname{sin}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495633} {:answer/id #uuid "37432da4-1104-5db3-8f3f-d145e4ff681b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{cos}^{2}⁡\theta {sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495638} {:answer/id #uuid "c1695142-7e5b-54c7-a0c8-e74c43072eb0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{4}{cos}^{2}⁡ϕ{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495936} {:answer/id #uuid "c737b74c-b7cd-528f-8697-a21b09e1b183" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{sin}^{2}⁡\theta {sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495946}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186495946} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb52fe98-2353-5c03-b8bc-f23854e8e611" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186496167}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "b06611cf-54db-58f0-8277-482f7aa27724" :question/math-academy-id "q-161753" :question/problem "The region $R$ is enclosed inside the sphere ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=3.$
Express the following triple integral in spherical polar coordinates. 

$$
{∭}_{R}{y}^{2}\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}}\,\text{d}V
$$" :question/worked-solution "We will use the change of variables formula in the form

$$
{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\,dV={∭}_{Δ}\,f(\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)\,{\rho }^{2}\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ.
$$

If $(\rho ,\theta ,ϕ)$ are the spherical coordinates of a point, then its Cartesian coordinates $(x,y,z)$ can be found by using the following formulas:

$$
x=\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\,y=\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\,z=\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ
$$

Notice that the region $R$ represents the sphere of radius $\sqrt{3}$ centered at the origin. 
As a result, in spherical polar coordinates, our region can be expressed as 

$$
Δ=\{(\rho ,\theta ,ϕ)\,:\,0\le \rho \le \sqrt{3},\,0\le \theta \le 2\pi ,\,0\le ϕ\le \pi \}.
$$

Next, we substitute the spherical polar coordinates into the function $f(x,y,z)={y}^{2}\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}}:$

$$
\begin{aligned}f(x,y,z) & =f(\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ,\rho \operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ) \\  & =(\rho \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ)^{2}\cdot \rho  \\  & ={\rho }^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain  

$$
\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}{y}^{2}\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}}\,\text{d}V & ={∭}_{Δ}{\rho }^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\cdot {\rho }^{2}\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ \\  & ={\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{sin}^{2}⁡\theta {sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "b0845655-b076-5af2-8d0f-f85412655856" :step/next {:db/id 17592186496352}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19b76607-eca3-5a84-8112-1e82b79c1646" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{cos}^{2}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495561} {:answer/id #uuid "3454506d-b82b-5713-b11f-01ee75904e1f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{4}\operatorname{sin}⁡\theta {sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495633} {:answer/id #uuid "37432da4-1104-5db3-8f3f-d145e4ff681b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{cos}^{2}⁡\theta {sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495638} {:answer/id #uuid "c1695142-7e5b-54c7-a0c8-e74c43072eb0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{3}{\rho }^{4}{cos}^{2}⁡ϕ{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495936} {:answer/id #uuid "c737b74c-b7cd-528f-8697-a21b09e1b183" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{sin}^{2}⁡\theta {sin}^{3}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495946}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186495946} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb52fe98-2353-5c03-b8bc-f23854e8e611" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186496167} {:answer/id #uuid "19b76607-eca3-5a84-8112-1e82b79c1646" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\int }_{0}^{\pi }{\int }_{0}^{2\pi }{\int }_{0}^{\sqrt{3}}{\rho }^{5}{cos}^{2}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡\theta \operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\,d\rho \,d\theta \,dϕ" :db/id 17592186495561} {:answer/id #uuid "3454506d-b82b-5713-b11f-01ee75904e1f" :answer/type {:db/id 1759218604549