Therefore, the distribution of the sample mean $\overset{―}{X}$ is

$$
\begin{aligned}\overset{―}{X} & ∼N\,(-14,\frac{{16}^{2}}{64}) \\  & ∼N(-14,4).\end{aligned}
$$

We're required to find $P(\overset{―}{X}>-14.86).$

First, we transform $X$ into a standard normal random variable $Z$ by $z$-scoring:

$$
\begin{aligned}P(\overset{―}{X}>-14.86) & =P(Z>\frac{-14.86-(-14)}{\sqrt{4}}) \\  & =P(Z>-0.43).\end{aligned}
$$

Using the complement of the normal distribution, we have

$$
\begin{aligned}P(Z>-0.43) & =1-P(Z\le -0.43) \\  & =1-Φ(-0.43).\end{aligned}
$$

From the table, we have

$$
\begin{aligned}Φ(-0.43)=0.3336.\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, 

$$
\begin{aligned}P(\overset{―}{X}>-14.86) & =1-Φ(-0.43) \\  & =1-0.3336 \\  & =0.6664.\end{aligned}
$$"} :step/id #uuid "80d34189-07b0-5bf3-baec-8db1e26b7c5e" :step/next {:db/id 17592186444051}} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3d659c90-71f0-5b00-8a65-403b2d145ad3" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.7019" :db/id 17592186444018} {:answer/id #uuid "4d6b56fe-fdc2-56d4-b7f6-9235b0fd6388" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6664" :db/id 17592186444020} {:answer/id #uuid "57c2e740-aa11-55a6-91c9-6d19dd52de74" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6628" :db/id 17592186444023} {:answer/id #uuid "de3eabca-7292-5160-8a6d-ec04e50a80e0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6700" :db/id 17592186444034} {:answer/id #uuid "f32f6209-a036-5022-95f2-57bcc51bce4a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6293" :db/id 17592186444037}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186444020} :answer-field/id #uuid "994729ba-d708-5678-96ba-cc1c965c4255" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493} :db/id 17592186444042} {:answer/id #uuid "3d659c90-71f0-5b00-8a65-403b2d145ad3" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.7019" :db/id 17592186444018} {:answer/id #uuid "4d6b56fe-fdc2-56d4-b7f6-9235b0fd6388" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6664" :db/id 17592186444020} {:answer/id #uuid "57c2e740-aa11-55a6-91c9-6d19dd52de74" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6628" :db/id 17592186444023} {:answer/id #uuid "de3eabca-7292-5160-8a6d-ec04e50a80e0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6700" :db/id 17592186444034} {:answer/id #uuid "f32f6209-a036-5022-95f2-57bcc51bce4a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.6293" :db/id 17592186444037} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e13a14a-41e6-597e-a638-642182912501" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.5478" :db/id 17592186444016} {:answer/id #uuid "6611d1e3-38dd-5c25-b23c-5999f0cd7010" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "0.5